# Google accounts pool for the Railway farm
# One account per line: email|password
# Also accepted: email:password  or  email<TAB>password
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to google_accounts.txt (gitignored) and fill it in.
# Every email here is consumed once: after a successful run it is appended to
# results/used_google.txt and skipped on the next run.
#
# Example:
# user1@gmail.com|MyPassword123
# user2@domain.com|AnotherPass456
